      why: "Later in the counting row = <b>more</b>. Numbers put the world in order." },
    { q: "One less than 10 = ?",
      type: "number", answer: 9,
      hints: ["Count backwards: 10 …", "One step back."],
      why: "Counting works <b>backwards</b> too – meet the number line, your friend for many years." }
  ]
},
