      hints: ["2 rows of 6 eggs, or 6 rows of 2 eggs – same box!"],
      why: "Swapping doesn't change the answer – so you only need to learn <b>half</b> the tables!" },
    { q: "9 · 10 = ?",
      type: "number", answer: 90,
